# libc|cxx_runtime|status|note
glibc|libstdc++|supported|Baseline GNU route.
glibc|libc++|supported|Uses glibc as target libc with LLVM runtimes for C++.
musl|libstdc++|supported|Static-friendly musl route with GNU libstdc++.
musl|libc++|supported|Uses musl as target libc with LLVM runtimes for C++.
llvm-libc|libc++|supported|Uses llvm-libc with a hybrid ARM glibc loader boundary.
llvm-libc|libstdc++|rejected|libstdc++ with llvm-libc is excluded in v1.